    "introduction": "This guide will teach you how to open up a BaByliss i-Pro 45 to change its batteries.\n3x AAA 1.2V batteries with U-lips are required to be soldered onto the motherboard.\nOpening up the device is an ideal opportunity to thoroughly clean it. Under the head/blades, some hairs may be stuck.",
    "what_you_need": {
        "parts": [
            {
                "text": "ENELOOP AAA with U‑lip",
                "url": "https://www.nkon.nl/rechargeable/aaa-size/aaa-eneloop-u-lip.html",
                "available_on": "https://www.nkon.nl/rechargeable/aaa-size/aaa-eneloop-u-lip.html",
                "view_link": "https://www.nkon.nl/rechargeable/aaa-size/aaa-eneloop-u-lip.html"
            }
        ],
        "tools": []
    },
    "steps": [
        {
            "step_number": 1,
            "title": "Remove the screws of the housing",
            "text": "Remove the rubber plug hiding the screw\nRemove the screw under the plug\nRemove two screws below the blades with a long Philips screwdriver",
            "image": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/2uPptV2aLbW3fwCm.medium",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/130334/255080",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 2,
            "title": "Remove the blade (Optional)",
            "text": "Remove the screws at the bottom of the blade\nRemove the blade",
            "image": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/E23JCVKLUuTKjqNC.medium",
            "image_links": [
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/E23JCVKLUuTKjqNC.200x150",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/oUotGcOiM6QVECU3.200x150"
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/130334/255081",
            "comment_links": [],
            "additional_images": [
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/oUotGcOiM6QVECU3.medium"
            ]
        },
        {
            "step_number": 3,
            "title": "Open the housing",
            "text": "Gently open the housing",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/130334/255082",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 4,
            "title": "Lift the circuit",
            "text": "open the plastic parts holding the circuit in place\nstart lifting from the tail",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/130334/255083",
            "comment_links": []
        }
    ],
    "conclusion": {
        "text": "To reassemble your device, follow these instructions in reverse order.",
